<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Aquagem - 155,000 tonnes coal Banjermasin/Rotterdam end Jan approx. $8.50 fio 15,000 shinc/40,000 shinc PT Adaro.</p>
<p>ORE - Santa Isabel - 150,000 tonnes Tuburao/Dunkirk west 20/1-5/2 approx. $5.90 6.5 days shinc Cobam.</p>
